WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:02.410
- So we're all celebrating
the 20th anniversary

00:00:02.410 --> 00:00:04.290
of the release of "Legally Blonde."

00:00:04.290 --> 00:00:05.830
And my reaction to "Legally Blonde" is one

00:00:05.830 --> 00:00:07.520
of the most watched videos on my channel.

00:00:07.520 --> 00:00:08.760
So I thought I'd take this opportunity

00:00:08.760 --> 00:00:09.820
to talk about what's accurate

00:00:09.820 --> 00:00:11.240
about this fantastic legal movie.

00:00:11.240 --> 00:00:13.210
- Girls, I'm going to Harvard.

00:00:13.210 --> 00:00:15.400
- [Devin] First of all,
a non pre-law major

00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:16.480
gets into law school.

00:00:16.480 --> 00:00:17.690
Yes, it happens all the time.

00:00:17.690 --> 00:00:18.523
Law schools hate the fact

00:00:18.523 --> 00:00:19.860
that they're always accepting pre-law

00:00:19.860 --> 00:00:20.720
and poli-sci majors.

00:00:20.720 --> 00:00:21.950
They like variety.

00:00:21.950 --> 00:00:23.680
- Well, sir, we've never had one before,

00:00:23.680 --> 00:00:25.860
and aren't we always
looking for diversity?

00:00:25.860 --> 00:00:28.120
- Elle Wood scores almost a perfect score

00:00:28.120 --> 00:00:30.284
on the LSAT and gets into Harvard Law.

00:00:30.284 --> 00:00:32.240
- 179! (screams in delight)

00:00:32.240 --> 00:00:34.490
- Yes, if you score as high
as she did on the LSAT,

00:00:34.490 --> 00:00:36.610
you'll probably get into Harvard Law.

00:00:36.610 --> 00:00:37.530
- Welcome to Harvard.

00:00:37.530 --> 00:00:39.350
- [Devin] Harvard Law
uses the Socratic method

00:00:39.350 --> 00:00:40.310
to terrorize students.

00:00:40.310 --> 00:00:41.580
Yes, all the time.

00:00:41.580 --> 00:00:42.920
Most law schools still do it.

00:00:42.920 --> 00:00:44.170
No, it's not a good teaching method,

00:00:44.170 --> 00:00:45.370
but they still do it.

00:00:45.370 --> 00:00:46.990
And Elle Woods faces sexual harassment

00:00:46.990 --> 00:00:48.048
in the legal field.

00:00:48.048 --> 00:00:49.770
- Are you hitting on me?

00:00:49.770 --> 00:00:50.670
- You're a beautiful girl.

00:00:50.670 --> 00:00:51.870
- [Devin] Yes, that still happens.

00:00:51.870 --> 00:00:53.450
Yes, it is still despicable.

00:00:53.450 --> 00:00:55.470
Hopefully we'll drive this
out of a legal profession.

00:00:55.470 --> 00:00:56.570
But that is "Legally Blonde,"

00:00:56.570 --> 00:00:58.153
what's accurate 20 years later.

